---
import experiences from "../collections/experiences.json";
import AboutExperience from "../components/about-experience.astro";
import PageHeading from "../components/page-heading.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/main.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site";

const paragraph =
  "text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-neutral-400 sm:leading-7 lg:leading-8 sm:text-base lg:text-lg";
const link = "text-indigo-600 underline";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="relative z-20 max-w-2xl mx-auto my-12 px-7 lg:px-0">
    <PageHeading
      title="About"
      description="Hello 👋 I'm Ahmed, a mobile engineer based in Alexandria, Egypt."
    />

    <h2 class="mt-10 mb-2 text-2xl font-bold dark:text-neutral-200">Short Bio</h2>
    <p class={paragraph}>
      I've been building mobile apps for more than ten years, mostly on
      Android, with iOS, Flutter and React Native along the way. At XonTel I
      worked on the Android apps for Monitor, a wall-mounted tablet product,
      and I now work in React Native with Expo.
    </p>
    <p class={`${paragraph} mt-4`}>
      Before XonTel I was a senior mobile engineer at Blink22, where I also did
      full-stack work in Java/Spring and Angular. Earlier I co-founded Hafezah
      in Riyadh as its tech lead, and built Android and iOS apps at BadrIT.
    </p>
    <p class={`${paragraph} mt-4`}>
      Lately I've been going deep into mobile app security. I've pentested a
      production app at work, and I'm working through HexTree's Android
      security training: dynamic instrumentation with Frida, network
      interception and reverse engineering.
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-5 mb-2 text-2xl font-bold lg:mt-10 sm:mt-6 dark:text-neutral-200"
    >
      Experience
    </h2>
    <div class="px-5 py-10">
      {
        experiences.map((experience) => {
          return (
            <div class="pb-10 border-l border-gray-200 last:border-l-0 dark:border-neutral-700">
              <AboutExperience
                dates={experience.dates}
                role={experience.role}
                company={experience.company}
                description={experience.description}
                logo={experience.logo}
              />
            </div>
          )
        })
      }
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-5 mb-2 text-2xl font-bold lg:mt-10 sm:mt-6 dark:text-neutral-200">Let's Connect</h2>
    <p class={paragraph}>
      The best way to reach me is on <a href={SITE.linkedin} target="_blank" class={link}>LinkedIn</a>.
      You can also find my code on <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" class={link}>GitHub</a>{
        SITE.email ? (
          <Fragment>, or send me an <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class={link}>email</a></Fragment>
        ) : null
      }.
      If you'd like my CV, <a href="/cv/" class={link}>request it here</a> and
      I'll email it to you.
      {
        SITE.cvPdf && (
          <Fragment>
            {" "}My CV is available <a href={SITE.cvPdf} class={link}>as a PDF</a>.
          </Fragment>
        )
      }
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
